   "locked": false,
   "text": "Honest limits\nEarly days: the browser feature is still an experiment and may change.\nThe AI-assistant step relied on an outside model that was down when I tested it.\nKept small on purpose. The next question is whether to offer smaller building blocks instead of a finished answer.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
